لي رأسًا على عقب، وتتعقد حياته هو وإنجي؛ حيث إنه شعر أن إنجي قد خانته.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.3}],"value":8.3,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":7061,"background_color":"","content_control":"NORMAL"}}